Searching for MICE events in Malaga, Spain, usually means someone who has to hold a meeting, an incentive, a conference or an exhibition here and wants to know what the destination offers and what the technical side involves. MICE stands for meetings, incentives, conferences and exhibitions. This page gives the figures that matter, the main venues and what we supply, what we source with partners and what we do not do.

Malaga Event Gear (MEG) supplies audiovisual equipment and a technician for corporate events across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol. We are not a venue, a destination management company, an event agency or an organizer. Our part of an event is the one covered by our [event technology service](/blog/event-technology-service/), where you can see the rest of what we offer.

