## Where We Deliver and How to Book

We are based in Malaga and deliver across the Costa del Sol: Marbella, Fuengirola, Torremolinos, Benalmadena, Estepona, Mijas, Ronda and Nerja are all in our service area, and we also serve Sevilla with no minimum order. Granada needs a booking over 400 euros to cover the single day travel.

We work delivery only, with no self pickup, and every booking needs at least 24 hours of notice. For a congress, book as soon as the dates are set, because the technician and the equipment are reserved for your sessions. [Contact us](/contact/) with your venue, your dates and the number of guests. If you are planning a congress, our guide on [how to organize a congress in Malaga](/blog/how-to-organize-a-congress-in-malaga/) covers the sequence.

## Conclusion

Malaga is an established MICE destination, with 2,190 meetings and 323,100 attendees in 2024 according to a report prepared for its Convention Bureau. We supply the audiovisual part of such an event: sound, a display or a projector, microphones and a technician, from the MICE Pack at 490 euros ex VAT. Interpretation, group hotels and anything outside our own inventory go through partners. [Contact us](/contact/) with your event details, or see the rest of what we offer on our [event technology service](/blog/event-technology-service/) page.

## FAQs

### What does MICE stand for?

MICE stands for meetings, incentives, conferences and exhibitions. In practice it covers corporate meetings, company incentive trips, congresses and trade fairs. Our part is the audiovisual side of any of them: sound, a display or a projector, microphones and a technician.

### Does Malaga Event Gear organize MICE events in Malaga?

No. We supply the audiovisual equipment and a technician. We are not a venue, a destination management company or an event agency, and we do not organize team building. Your organizer or agency handles the rest, and we work with them on the technical side. For group hotels we work with our partner Top Group Express.

### Which package suits a corporate meeting or a congress?

The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), at 490 euros ex VAT, is for up to 120 guests and includes a 60 inch LED display, a gooseneck and a wireless handheld microphone and a technician for up to 6 hours. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/), at 295 euros ex VAT, is for up to 40 guests. For a bigger room, tell us the layout and the program.

### Can you provide simultaneous interpretation for a congress?

Not with our own equipment. We coordinate interpretation with a subcontracted partner, so we do not publish a model or a price. Tell us the languages, the number of listeners and the room, and we check with the partner. Some venues also have interpretation booths, so ask the venue as well.

### Can you deliver to any venue in Malaga, Marbella or Torremolinos?

Yes, within our service area, which includes Malaga, the Costa del Sol and Sevilla, and Granada for bookings over 400 euros. We have worked at a hotel convention center in Torremolinos and at FYCMA. Check loading access and venue rules with the venue before the day, and [contact us](/contact/) with the address.

### What AV Does a Sales Kickoff Event Need?

For the general session, a sales kickoff needs sound, a screen or a projector, microphones for the keynote and a technician. The MICE Pack covers that for up to 120 guests at 490 euros ex VAT: professional active speakers, a 60 inch LED display, a gooseneck and a wireless handheld microphone and a technician for up to 6 hours. Send us the run of show so the technician knows each microphone change. The speaker runs their own slides.

For more rooms or a bigger guest list, tell us the rooms and the program and we check what we can supply from our own inventory. Streaming, hybrid events and video walls are not in our own inventory, so tell us what you need and we look for a solution with our suppliers, if there is one.
